meta {
  name: Create a mailbox
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/identities
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "pow_challenge": "string",
    "pow_solution": "string",
    "label": "string",
    "handle": "string"
  }
}

docs {
  With an API key or member token: created under that account, no proof-of-work, optionally
  under a `handle` the account is authorised for. Anonymous (no bearer): proof-of-work and the
  per-IP mint budget apply, `handle` is ignored, and the mailbox is ephemeral. A capability
  token cannot create mailboxes (400 `use_api_key`).
}
